  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "The best result so far is config_005 (scvi_n200, multiprofile, avgpool, RNA-only) at 0.650 accuracy. The key remaining question is whether adding the image modality via fusion can improve upon this strong RNA-only baseline. Config_030 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, resnet50, avgpool, concat) is a direct extension of config_005 that isolates the effect of adding image features through concatenation fusion, keeping all RNA-side settings identical. Although resnet50 image alone is weak (0.208), concat fusion may still capture complementary spatial information. If it beats 0.650, we have a new best and can explore ViT-L or weighted fusion in the remaining 3 experiments; if it does not, we efficiently rule out resnet50-based multimodal and redirect remaining budget toward ViT-L image encoder or further RNA-only optimization. This is the highest-information single experiment given 3 remaining slots."
}

